### Signature Composition — Light Reveals Texture
- Use a centered copy island above a subtle full-width dot texture, with a spotlight confined to a decorative background layer.
- Headline, subhead, navigation and CTAs retain full contrast independent of pointer location; the spotlight only reveals background dots.
- Introduce a narrow bottom rule and small product descriptor. No glowing borders on every control and no replacement custom cursor.

